 "recipe": 3,
 "purpose": "KV-PLAN-FIN 2026-10-17: the PV final join of the KV die as ONE 512-b beat-stream slice (die element pvfin, between the two PV pair strips W of the attention hub): beat b = fp32_mul(fp32_add(p0_b, p1_b), rz[b/8]) x 16 lanes, the reference finalize's arithmetic per block (ot_qwen_tp8_pv256_finalize_static_cal), static calendar {R, P1, P0}, every input registered at the pin, every output a flop. Replaces 32 join16 slices (512 add + 512 mul) and two 16,384-b die words (plan results/arch/qwen_kv_pvfin_1017/plan.json).  KV-KITS-ATTN 10-18: re-kit for the QXF-FACE b6d08acc2 RTL (join on max(P0, P1, R): 32 x 512-b sum buffer sbuf + 512-b 32:1 read mux, +16,384 flops).",
