 "structural_change": "KV-KITS-ATTN 10-18 (RTL change, re-gate owed): QXF-FACE b6d08acc2 makes qkd_pv_fin_s join on max(P0, P1, R) (compiler STRETCH=1 law): the 32 sums are kept in a 32 x 512-b buffer read at MUL_AGE + b (+16,384 flops, 512-b 32:1 read mux). Outline kept at the die frame 259.2 x 259.2 (kv_static_die.PVFIN_FRAME): the f1 gate measured std 23,793 um2 at util 0.37; the buffer adds ~7.5-8k um2 (16,384 DFF + write enables + read mux) -> util ~0.48 (<= 0.60), square, faces unchanged. Earlier: KV-PLAN-FIN 10-17 new element (no closed predecessor view).",
